&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:5.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(b) 仕入実績&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度の仕入実績をセグメントごとに示すと、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
